Description: Currency converter for Nokia N9 (by Claude with smyhu)
 Favourite currencies, live conversion, about 170 currencies and
 popular cryptocurrencies, letter scroller, search by name, code or
 symbol, rates in the Events feed refreshed in the background.
 Polish, English, German, Spanish, Italian and French. Dark UI for the
 AMOLED screen.
